# Every text file is stored with LF, whatever the contributor's platform
# does on checkout. The tree has been 100% LF since the first commit; this
# only stops a Windows clone without `core.autocrlf` from committing CRLF
# and failing `ruff format --check` on the Linux and macOS CI legs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts are never normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.npz binary
*.npy binary
*.faiss binary
*.pdf binary
